cal cutoffs are applied to this version here. The score is not a diagnosis, norm or percentile."],"meaning":"Global core strength: positivity: {{value}} (1–5). Higher scores describe a combined pattern of hope, enthusiasm, reciprocal care, gratitude, forgiveness and accepting love; lower scores describe less endorsement of that combination. Different response patterns can yield the same mean; it is not a happiness or mental-health total. This continuous self-description uses Holistic House explanatory prose, not a validated interpretation category; scale endpoints describe possible scores, not norms or percentiles. Mean of 6 responses, after reversing the items specified by the key. No verified clinical categories are assigned to this result here.","presentationDirection":"neutral","recommendedReview":false,"reliableDirection":true,"source":"https://ipip.ori.org/IPIP-VIA-R-core-strengths_Key.html","summary":"Higher scores describe a combined pattern of hope, enthusiasm, reciprocal care, gratitude, forgiveness and accepting love; lower scores describe less endorsement of that combination. Different response patterns can yield the same mean; it is not a happiness or mental-health total. This continuous self-description uses Holistic House explanatory prose, not a validated interpretation category; scale endpoints describe possible scores, not norms or percentiles.","verified":true},"values":[1,1.17,1.33,1.5,1.67,1.83,2,2.17,2.33,2.5,2.67,2.83,3,3.17,3.33,3.5,3.67,3.83,4,4.17,4.33,4.5,4.67,4.83,5]}]}],"discoveryClassification":{"basis":"discovery-only-not-clinical-validation","kind":"professional","policySource":"lib/assessments/test-kinds.js","policySourceCommit":"d9ba8b92eb7bff99864d5403d9a78a199b727892","policySourceSha256":"sha256:77c573884f78cdc8c4fb58b15990dcce50218c4b6666a89c1ffe2fe8a4142167"},"interpretationVersion":"2026-10-17.v1","provenance":{"assessmentVersionId":"24df183a-da18-5e99-bba8-d4f1210e7964","contentHash":"sha256:ac178dac957f016420a331771e082346c2